# nexora-action-code: get_irf
Value MEMBER_ID (\d+)
Value ROLE (\S+)
Value PRIORITY (\d+)
Value CPU_MAC ([0-9A-Fa-f-]+)
Value DESCRIPTION (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*[*+]*${MEMBER_ID}\s+${ROLE}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${CPU_MAC}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*MemberID\s+Role\s+Priority\s+CPU-Mac
  ^\s*-+
  ^\s*[*+]\s+indicates
  ^\s*The\s+(?:Bridge MAC|Domain ID|Auto upgrade|Mac persistent)
